This license covers the Windroid glue in this repository (kernel config
fragment, rootfs build scripts, installer, tray, CLI, docs).

Windroid BUNDLES and BUILDS UPON third-party software under its own terms —
none of it is relicensed here:

- Linux kernel (microsoft/WSL2-Linux-Kernel) — GPL-2.0
- Waydroid — GPL-3.0; the Android system images it fetches are
  LineageOS/AOSP (Apache-2.0 plus the licenses of their components)
- Weston / WSLg — MIT
- Ubuntu base rootfs — per-package licenses (mostly GPL/MIT/BSD)
- Preinstalled apps, fetched from F-Droid at image-build time and shipped
  unmodified: Aurora Store (GPL-3.0), Fennec/Firefox for Android
  (MPL-2.0), Material Files (GPL-3.0)
- Inno Setup (installer wizard toolchain) — modified-BSD-style, see
  jrsoftware.org

Google Apps (GApps) images are NOT redistributed by this project under any
circumstances; the `-Gapps` installer flag fetches them on the user's own
machine (see docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-004).
